Okay, i got that. The mistake was: Wrong signs. <br><br>dSolveLCP expects an LCP of the form: Ax = b+w. Mine was of the form: <br>w - Ax = b --&gt; Ax = b-w<br><br>so the line: <br>A *= -1.0; <br><br>saved my weekend <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_wink.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=";)" title="Wink"> <br><br>Thanks anyway!<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=637">thomas-jung</a> — Fri Jul 14, 2006 7:21 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
